%%{init: {
  "flowchart": {
    "nodeSpacing": 10,
    "rankSpacing": 30,
    "padding": 4,
    "curve": "linear"
  },
  "themeVariables": {
    "fontSize": "10px",
    "fontFamily": "Arial, sans-serif"
  }
}}%%

flowchart TD

classDef start    fill:#fef3e8,stroke:#C47A1E,color:#1a1a2e,rx:12
classDef step     fill:#fef9c3,stroke:#C47A1E,color:#1a1a2e
classDef decision fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#1a1a2e
classDef income   fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#991b1b,color:#1a1a2e
classDef relief   fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#166534,color:#1a1a2e
classDef cgt      fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#5b21b6,color:#1a1a2e
classDef iht      fill:#fae8ff,stroke:#86198f,color:#1a1a2e
classDef corp     fill:#fff1f2,stroke:#be123c,color:#1a1a2e
classDef filing   fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0369a1,color:#1a1a2e
classDef end1      fill:#C47A1E,stroke:#C47A1E,color:#fff,rx:12
classDef none     fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#9ca3af,color:#374151,rx:12

START([Tax year begins]):::start --> RES

RES{UK resident?}:::decision
RES -->|Uncertain| SRT[Statutory Residence Test]:::step
RES -->|Yes| DOM
SRT --> DOM

DOM{Domicile?}:::decision
DOM -->|UK domiciled: worldwide basis| INC
DOM -->|Non-dom: remittance or arising basis| REM[Remittance basis election]:::step
REM --> INC

INC{Income sources?}:::decision

INC -->|Employment| E1[Salary · bonuses · benefits]:::income
E1 --> E2[PAYE at source]:::income
E2 --> E3[NIC Class 1]:::income
E3 --> E4{Share schemes?}:::decision
E4 -->|Approved| E5[EMI / CSOP / SAYE / SIP tax-advantaged]:::relief
E4 -->|Unapproved| E6[RSUs: IT + NIC on vest]:::income
E4 -->|None| POOL
E5 & E6 --> POOL

INC -->|Self-employment| S1[Profits minus expenses]:::income
S1 --> S2[NIC Class 2 + 4]:::income
S2 --> S3{Trading loss?}:::decision
S3 -->|Yes| S4[Offset · carry back · forward]:::relief
S3 -->|No| POOL
S4 --> POOL

INC -->|Savings interest| I1{Within savings allowance?}:::decision
I1 -->|Yes| I2[Tax-free]:::relief
I1 -->|No| I3[Taxed at marginal rate]:::income
I2 & I3 --> POOL

INC -->|Dividends| D1{Within £500 allowance?}:::decision
D1 -->|Yes| D2[Tax-free]:::relief
D1 -->|No| D3[8.75 / 33.75 / 39.35 pct]:::income
D2 & D3 --> POOL

INC -->|Rental| R1[Income minus expenses Mortgage: basic rate only]:::income
R1 --> R2{Rental loss?}:::decision
R2 -->|Yes| R3[Carry forward against future rental only]:::relief
R2 -->|No| POOL
R3 --> POOL

INC -->|Pension| P1[State · occupational · drawdown 25 pct lump sum at crystallisation]:::income
P1 --> POOL

POOL[Income pool Ordering: non-savings · savings · dividends]:::step --> PA

PA{Above personal allowance?}:::decision
PA -->|No| BELOW([No income tax NIC may still apply]):::none
PA -->|Yes| TAPER

TAPER{ANI above 100k?}:::decision
TAPER -->|Yes| PTAPER[PA tapers to zero at 125k]:::relief
TAPER -->|No| BANDS
PTAPER --> BANDS

BANDS[Income tax bands 20 / 40 / 45 pct]:::step --> WRAPPERS

WRAPPERS[Gift Aid · pension relief · ISA]:::relief --> CGT_Q

CGT_Q{Chargeable disposals?}:::decision
CGT_Q -->|No| IHT_Q
CGT_Q -->|Yes| CGT_TYPE{Asset type?}:::decision

CGT_TYPE -->|Residential property| CG1[Gain minus cost PPR may apply]:::cgt
CGT_TYPE -->|Shares / other| CG2[Gain minus cost Share matching rules]:::cgt
CGT_TYPE -->|Cryptoassets| CG3[Each disposal taxable Pooling rules]:::cgt
CGT_TYPE -->|Private co / business| CG4[BADR · Investors Relief Rollover · hold-over]:::cgt

CG1 & CG2 & CG3 & CG4 --> CGTL

CGTL{Losses?}:::decision
CGTL -->|Yes| CGTLA[Offset current year then carry forward]:::relief
CGTL -->|No| CGTA
CGTLA --> CGTA

CGTA[Annual exempt amount: 3k Rates: 18-24 pct property · 10-20 pct other]:::cgt --> IHT_Q

IHT_Q{Death or chargeable transfer?}:::decision
IHT_Q -->|No| CORP_Q
IHT_Q -->|Yes| IHT1[Value estate All UK assets]:::iht
IHT1 --> IHT2[NRB 325k + TNRB + RNRB 175k PETs within 7 years]:::iht
IHT2 --> IHT3{BPR / APR?}:::decision
IHT3 -->|Yes| IHT4[100 or 50 pct relief Capped 1m from 2026]:::relief
IHT3 -->|No| IHT5
IHT4 --> IHT5
IHT5[40 pct above nil rate bands]:::iht --> CORP_Q

CORP_Q{Own a company?}:::decision
CORP_Q -->|No| VAT_Q
CORP_Q -->|Yes| CT1[Taxable profits Capital allowances · RD · Patent Box]:::corp
CT1 --> CT2{Loss?}:::decision
CT2 -->|Yes| CT3[Offset · carry back · forward]:::relief
CT2 -->|No| CT4
CT3 --> CT4
CT4[19 pct up to 50k · 25 pct above 250k]:::corp --> CT5{Extract profits?}:::decision
CT5 -->|Salary| CT6[Deductible · IT + NIC]:::corp
CT5 -->|Dividends| CT7[Not deductible · dividend rates]:::corp
CT5 -->|Director loan| CT8[S455 tax if not repaid]:::corp
CT6 & CT7 & CT8 --> VAT_Q

VAT_Q{Turnover above 90k?}:::decision
VAT_Q -->|No| SDLT_Q
VAT_Q -->|Yes| VAT1[Register · quarterly returns Output minus input · MTD]:::corp
VAT1 --> SDLT_Q

SDLT_Q{Property acquired?}:::decision
SDLT_Q -->|No| SA
SDLT_Q -->|Yes| SDLT1[SDLT / LBTT / LTT 0-12 pct + surcharges]:::filing
SDLT1 --> SA

SA{Self-assessment required?}:::decision
SA -->|PAYE only| NONE([No filing required]):::none
SA -->|Yes| SA1[Complete return All income · gains · reliefs]:::filing
SA1 --> SA2[Deadlines: 31 Jan online 31 Oct paper · POA Jan + Jul]:::filing
SA2 --> SA3{On time?}:::decision
SA3 -->|No| SA4[Penalties: 100 immediate 10 per day after 3 months]:::filing
SA3 -->|Yes| ENQ
SA4 --> ENQ

ENQ{HMRC enquiry?}:::decision
ENQ -->|No| PAY
ENQ -->|Yes| ENQ1[Enquiry · discovery · penalties Careless 0-30 pct · deliberate 20-70 pct]:::filing
ENQ1 --> APP{Appeal?}:::decision
APP -->|Yes| APP1[FTT · Upper Tribunal · Courts]:::filing
APP -->|No| PAY
APP1 --> PAY

PAY[Pay balance Reclaim overpayment]:::filing --> END_UK

END_UK([Year complete No carry-forward of wealth position Each year assessed from scratch]):::end1
